# Object translation delta (header `Field Label (EN)` + new-field only)

English for object/field labels is the column whose header is **`Field Label (EN)`**
(JP `項目ラベル名 (EN)`). Locate it by **header name** (same as `WIP`, `IsDelete`,
`fullName`). Untranslated tabs have no `Field Label (EN)` header; do not invent
one or treat `fullName` as English. Object-level English is row 1 of that same
column (`fetch_sheet.py` via `col_map`).

Live Data Dictionary:
https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_TaxDe-Qxl8BAUmuZc01vUoxpBEPxJ4Opx4tEe8ulNQ

Japanese `Field Label` remains `CustomField.label`. Do **not** write `Field Label (EN)`
into `generate_xml.py` field `<label>`.

## Every object/field deploy (not a separate project)

`prep_deploy.py` Step 4b always runs after field XML:

1. `translation_drift.py --rows temp_updates.json --org <ORG> --new-only`
2. `generate_object_translation.py --rows … --delta …` — retrieve the org
   `CustomObjectTranslation` `<Obj>__c-en_US` and **merge** the new field so
   sibling EN is not wiped.
3. The member `CustomObjectTranslation:<Obj>__c-en_US` rides in the **same**
   package as the CustomField delta.

| Code | When | Package? |
|---|---|---|
| `NEW_TRANSLATION` | EN filled, no `en_US` translation in the org | **Yes — automatic** |
| `CHANGED_EN` | Org EN ≠ sheet EN | **Report only.** Redeploy only if the user asks. |
| `MISSING_TRANSLATION` | Deployable custom field, EN blank | WARN; deploy JA field; **do not invent English** |

Honor WIP / IsDelete / `END[項目]` like every other field row. Blank EN is a WARN,
not a Step 0 hard blocker.

## Future field add (Japan team)

Sheet row: JA in `Field Label`, EN in `Field Label (EN)`, API in `fullName`.
Next `prep_deploy.py` for that tab: field name-delta creates the CustomField;
`--new-only` marks only that row `NEW_TRANSLATION`; generate merges it into the
org COT. Existing translations stay as they are.
